<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.10		 40.15</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	62.60		 62.70</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.20		 26.25</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.360		 0.362</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.67		 10.69</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    10.91		 10.93</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		i money rates</p>
<p>closed up and overnight activity remained subdued amid a general lack of liquidity in the system on Tuesids and offers were quoted at 15 and 15.50 percent but deals remained scarce, the dealer said.</p>
</text>
